+-- Scope: 24 GLOBAL rows (country NULL) covering every category x tier, plus
+-- per-country rows for 64 countries derived by scaling the global baseline by
+-- a curated relative price index. The budget engine resolves city -> country
+-- -> global, so with the global rows present EVERY trip now gets an estimate.
+--
+-- HONESTY: confidence='curated', source_note flags these as indicative curated
+-- baselines (NOT a live cost-of-living feed). This is the admin-curated state
+-- the data roadmap expects to REPLACE with a licensed provider (Numbeo) once
+-- there are live users — the confidence column makes that a clean pair-by-pair
+-- swap (curated rows always override provider rows).
